## Stand out and shine

Endera does things differently. CEO John Walsh was building a place for a young company among long-established manufacturers, and he needed the brand to look as solid as the buses.

## How do you grow a B2B business?

You build trust. We produced product films, partnership stories, and customer testimonials packed with the key messages, the competitive edge, and real results from the road.

## A top five bus assembly plant

When we started with Endera, the team was a handful of people. Today Endera employs more than 100 people, runs a quarter million square foot plant in Ohio, and is one of the leading names in electric buses.
